sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant D as Desktop app / browser
    participant AS as assessment-service
    actor T as Trainer

    S->>D: open a secure test
    D->>D: pre-checks
    Note right of D: remote-control software scan (AnyDesk, TeamViewer, Getscreen...)<br/>camera and microphone permission<br/>face oval, same face, phone detection (in the browser, MediaPipe)
    D->>AS: start attempt
    AS-->>D: paper + rules (secure mode, max violations, camera, mic)

    loop during the test
        D->>D: full screen, copy block, tab-visibility watch
        alt tab switched or full screen left
            D->>AS: POST /quiz-attempts/{id}/violations
            AS->>AS: count + 1
            alt count reaches max_violations
                AS->>AS: status IN_PROGRESS -> TERMINATED
                AS-->>D: test ended
            else below the limit
                AS-->>D: warning shown
            end
        else camera event (face missing, other face, phone)
            D->>AS: violation of a camera type
            AS->>AS: recorded, warn only, never terminates
        else remote tool detected
            D->>AS: remote tool violation
            AS->>AS: recorded
        end
        D->>AS: typing chunks of coding answers
        AS->>AS: typed vs pasted counts
    end

    T->>AS: GET violations and typing stats
    AS-->>T: events with times, pasted-code flag, typing replay
    T->>AS: optional: give this student another attempt
